# The Authenticated Origin Pulls overlay (LDA-H3) is box-only: a client-auth
# snippet (*.caddy) plus Cloudflare's origin-pull CA (*.pem) are dropped into
# this directory on the production host and must NEVER be committed. Keep the
# directory in git (so the compose bind mount and the Caddyfile glob import have
# something to point at), but ignore everything that lands in it.
#
# See deploy/README.md ("Authenticated Origin Pulls").
*
!.gitignore
